          "id": "trojan_horse",
          "mode": "landmark",
          "brief": "A colossal wooden effigy of a horse standing on a massive wheeled timber platform, carpentered from weathered pine and oak hull planks (api.theme.wood) with dark iron strap reinforcement, thick hemp haul ropes coiled at the wheeled base, and subtle concealed seam lines along the hollow belly where Greek hoplites wait in silence. An egress hatch on the flank and the boarding stair anchor as door.",
